Description:It is your first main phase. You control Ledger Shredder (1/3 flying; whenever a player casts their second spell each turn, it connives) and have Ornithopter and Memnite in hand. Your library is all Colossal Dreadmaws. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-connive-nonland-discard | Conniving draws a card, then discards one, and puts a +1/+1 counter on the creature if a nonland card was discarded (CR 701.50a): casting both free artifacts triggers the Shredder, which discards the drawn Dreadmaw and attacks as a 2/4; one spell gives no connive
